# Master Admin ShoutOuts — compliance logging & retention

Design notes only (not FloqAi help). Resume: `@master-shoutouts$`.

## Why Completed log was empty (diagnosed)

- Collection `shoutoutComplianceLogs` was **empty** — wiring existed, but:
  1. Live trigger only indexed a narrow status set (missed many `pending` / historical rows).
  2. Backfill was never run (or filtered too tightly), so historical data never populated.
  3. Many approved ShoutOut docs were later cleared/`stale`, so reconstructing from `shoutouts` alone is incomplete.

## Reconstructable sources (available)

| Source | What it has |
|---|---|
| `clubLocations` | Venue names, city, ids for typeahead search |
| `shoutouts` | Live / pending / stale rows with venue + copy |
| `shoutoutAudit` | submitted / approved / rejected timeline + clubLocationId + reference |
| `inboxNotifications` (`paidShoutoutReceipt`, `shoutoutStatus`) | Location name, reference, paid/approved/rejected signals |

Backfill callable `backfillShoutoutComplianceLogs` merges these into `shoutoutComplianceLogs`.

## Standards mapping

| Control set | FloqR implementation |
|---|---|
| SOC 2 CC6 / CC7 | `shoutoutComplianceLogs` + append-only `shoutoutAudit` on submit/pay/approve/reject/end/media_purged |
| ISO 27001 A.8.15 / A.5.28 / A.5.33 | Master-Admin-only read; no client delete of compliance rows; evidence searchable |
| NIST 800-53 AU-2 / AU-3 / AU-11 | Who / what / when / venue / outcome; **7-year** metadata retention |
| GDPR storage limitation + accountability | Media deleted after **90 days**; metadata anonymized after **7 years**; legal hold supported |

**Not claimed:** forever compressed media archives as a SOC 2 / ISO requirement.

**60 days:** UI default search window only. Do **not** delete compliance metadata at 60 days — that conflicts with AU-11 / SOC 2 audit retention.

## Master Admin UI

Tab group **ShoutOuts**:

- **Completed log** — venue typeahead from `clubLocations`, lifecycle filter (submitted / rejected / completed), content + date; **Rebuild compliance log**
- **Retention** — 7y / 90d / 60d UI window policy + rebuild

## Collections

- `shoutoutComplianceLogs/{shoutoutId}` — upserted from `shoutouts` writes + reconstruct backfill
- `shoutoutComplianceMeta/retention` — purge / backfill stamps
- `shoutoutAudit/{id}` — create + limited read; no update/delete

## Actor identity + IP

| Field | Source |
|---|---|
| `actorEmail` / `actorPhone` / `actorIdentifier` | shoutout `submittedBy`, `shoutoutAudit.actorEmail`, Inbox `recipientEmail`, `users/{uid}` email/phone |
| `clientIp` / `ipSource` | checkout callable (`serviceOrders.clientIp` → paid shoutout), `stampShoutoutActorContext` for free submits, optional `appLogs.clientIp` when present |

Display security logs (`displayAccessLogs`) are board/kiosk IPs — not used as the patron submitter IP.

Historical rows may show email/phone after Rebuild even when IP is blank (IP was not stored before this pass).
